    "summary": "Spend 2 CP in any Command phase on one ADEPTA SORORITAS unit in your army; it is blessed for the rest of the turn. A blessed unit is free to disregard some or all modifiers applied to its models' characteristics, to the WS or BS of weapons its models carry, and to every roll or test taken for it, though modifiers to saving throws still apply. If the chosen unit is a JUMP PACK unit, then for the rest of the turn any friendly ADEPTA SORORITAS unit within 3\" of it is blessed as well.",
